$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 3,5-Diacetylamino-1-phenyl-1,2,4-triazole (13a). A mixture of compound 1a
(1.05 g, 6 mmol) in Ac2O (5 ml) was refluxed for 6 h, the excess of
anhydride was distilled off in vacuum, and the residue crystallized from
a DMF-EtOH, 1:2 mixture. Compound 13a, yield 1.28 g, 82%. mp 210-212°C.
UV spectrum, λmax, nm (ε): 218 sh (18000). IR spectrum, ν, cm-1: 1680
(CO). 1H NMR spectrum, δ, ppm: 1.96 (3H, s, CH3); 2.04 (3H, s, CH3);
7.35-7.58 (5H, m, C6H5); 10.48 (1H, s, NH); 10.58 (1H, s, NH). Found, %:
N 27.2. C12H13N5O2. Calculated, %: N 27.0.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
